    ## 7. Common Mistake                                                                      
                                                                                              
    Don’t say: “help me to learning English.”                                                 
    Say: “help me learn English” or “help me to learn English.”                               
                                                                                              
    ## 8. One Sentence to Remember                                                            
                                                                                              
    I want to build a translation app that can help me learn English.                         
